Bundled third-party code
========================

Each library is pinned in tools/vendor/manifest.tsv (release, commit and
archive SHA-256), trimmed to the files in tools/vendor/<library>.files, and
patched only by the patches named below. tools/vendor/verify checks the
vendored tree against tools/vendor/checksums.sha256. zupix_info() reports
the same versions, commits and patches at run time. The full licence texts
are installed with the package under licenses/.

